00:39:18.713 --> 00:39:19.756
di mana ia

645
00:39:20.215 --> 00:39:21.424
ya, kami berjalan lancar

646
00:39:22.008 --> 00:39:24.052
Oh, saya baru melintasi Jambatan Seongan sebentar tadi.

647
00:39:25.428 --> 00:39:26.262
ya

648
00:39:26.971 --> 00:39:28.264
Boleh tak?

649
00:39:29.474 --> 00:39:30.975
ya? Apa itu?

650
00:39:32.644 --> 00:39:35.271
Adakah anda masih sihat?

651
00:39:36.147 --> 00:39:37.357
Oh, apa itu...

652
00:39:56.376 --> 00:39:57.961
Terima kasih, Dojin.

653
00:39:57.961 --> 00:39:59.754
Saya menyumpah orang itu

654
00:39:59.754 --> 00:40:03.383
Saya fikir saya akan mati kerana saya takut.
Bukankah saya melakukannya dengan baik? Lakonan pun bagus

655
00:40:03.383 --> 00:40:06.886
Nah, rupanya tidak teruk pada tahap ini.
Jadi, saya memasuki industri hiburan...

656
00:41:13.328 --> 00:41:17.790
Ya ampun
Saya harap awak sedar, Boss Ma, Boss Ma?

657
00:41:17.790 --> 00:41:19.667
Adakah anda cedera parah?

658
00:41:21.294 --> 00:41:25.006
Hei, En.
Wi Chang-ok, jalang yang akan merobek awak sampai mati

659
00:41:25.548 --> 00:41:28.051
Saya akan menghubungi polis dan perkhidmatan kecemasan dengan segera.

660
00:41:29.344 --> 00:41:31.012
tak boleh

661
00:41:31.721 --> 00:41:32.722
jangan buat

662
00:41:33.348 --> 00:41:34.849
Jangan buat, jalang gila.

663
00:41:35.058 --> 00:41:36.809
Ah, oops

664
00:41:37.602 --> 00:41:40.813
Boss Ma dikehendaki sekarang.
Saya tahu, kan?

665
00:41:41.105 --> 00:41:43.191
Kemudian, jika anda melaporkannya, keadaan akan berjalan lancar.

666
00:41:43.525 --> 00:41:45.318
Bolehkah anda sekurang-kurangnya memberitahu pengerusi?

667
00:41:46.402 --> 00:41:47.237
sepasang

668
00:41:48.071 --> 00:41:49.906
Tidak bolehkah kamu menutup mulutnya?

669
00:41:50.406 --> 00:41:52.200
{\an8}우재요
우재

670
00:41:52.742 --> 00:41:58.706
근데 회장님은 자기 50억이 털린 걸 아나 모르겄소
걱정 마오

671
00:41:59.123 --> 00:42:02.502
그 50억 우리한테 잘 와 있으니

672
00:42:16.224 --> 00:42:17.767
됐어, 됐어

673
00:42:17.767 --> 00:42:19.143
됐어

674
00:42:19.143 --> 00:42:20.395
미안하게 됐소

675
00:42:21.020 --> 00:42:23.606
개다리 노릇 하모 배운 게
이런 거뿐이라

676
00:42:24.274 --> 00:42:25.441
야, 이, 씨

677
00:42:26.484 --> 00:42:27.318
야

678
00:42:27.944 --> 00:42:29.821
너랑 그 새끼, 씨

679
00:42:29.821 --> 00:42:31.990
둘 다 죽여 버릴 거야, 내가

680
00:42:31.990 --> 00:42:33.950
아이고
가따나 아득한 정신에

681
00:42:33.950 --> 00:42:35.577
남 걱정까지 하고 그러오

682
00:42:36.077 --> 00:42:37.078
걱정 마오

683
00:42:37.620 --> 00:42:40.164
그럼
잘 가라, 이 개새끼야

684
00:42:40.164 --> 00:42:41.374
야...

685
00:42:41.958 --> 00:42:42.792
Hei

686
00:42:44.168 --> 00:42:45.962
Hei! Lee, En.

687
00:42:46.254 --> 00:42:49.465
Hei! Persetankan ini

688
00:43:30.089 --> 00:43:31.883
{\an8}Anda perlu berhati-hati mulai sekarang

689
00:43:31.883 --> 00:43:33.718
{\an8}Mereka tidak akan kekal diam.

690
00:43:33.718 --> 00:43:35.970
{\an8}Awak kenal dia dari awal lagi kan?

691
00:43:36.387 --> 00:43:38.264
{\an8}Saya tidak mengenali wajah dengan baik

692
00:43:38.264 --> 00:43:40.183
{\an8}Tatu pelik di leher...

693
00:43:40.183 --> 00:43:43.394
{\an8}Semalam dekat Jambatan Seongan
Seorang lelaki hilang?

694
00:43:43.394 --> 00:43:44.354
{\an8}Tiada?

695
00:43:44.354 --> 00:43:46.773
{\an8}Tetapi lelaki itu
Saya fikir ia adalah sfera ajaib

696
00:43:46.773 --> 00:43:49.943
{\an8}Walaupun saya menjumpai kanak-kanak itu
Saya rasa saya sudah tiada wang.

697
00:43:50.193 --> 00:43:53.446
{\an8}Pencuri sebenar
tolong bawa saya ke hadapan awak

698
00:43:53.446 --> 00:43:54.989
{\an8}Adakah anda pasti ia adalah sfera ajaib?

699
00:43:55.281 --> 00:43:57.325
{\an8}Nyawa anda mungkin dalam bahaya

700
00:43:57.325 --> 00:44:00.995
{\an8}Lalu mengapa?
Saya terus mengelilingi awak

701
00:44:01.829 --> 00:44:02.664
{\an8}Park Jeong-hoon!

702
00:44:03.414 --> 00:44:06.251
{\an8}Di manakah Maseok-gu di Korea?

